    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The facts of the case are that Bitten @ Sonia gave her statement to the police that while she was working in Civil Hospital, Sector-6, Panchkula she came in contact with Kiran who was working in a Beauty Parlour.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 714,
      "end": 927,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bitten @ Sonia",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 746,
          "end": 760
        },
        {
          "text": "Civil Hospital, Sector-6, Panchkula",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 824,
          "end": 859
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiran",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 885,
          "end": 890
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18953567743301392
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The complainant left her job three months ago but she was in touch with Kiran.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 928,
      "end": 1006,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kiran",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1000,
          "end": 1005
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30442309379577637
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "They started visiting each others house.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1007,
      "end": 1048,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22261399030685425
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Kiran invited her on the birthday of her younger brother namely Deepak.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1049,
      "end": 1120,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kiran",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1049,
          "end": 1054
        },
        {
          "text": "Deepak",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1113,
          "end": 1119
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.312538743019104
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "There she met Vijay @ Sonu brother of Kiran.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1121,
      "end": 1165,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vijay @ Sonu",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1135,
          "end": 1147
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiran",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1159,
          "end": 1164
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26390254497528076
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "In the absence of Kiran and her mother, Vijay @ Sonu gave her some intoxicant-substance in the cold drink and SANDEEP developed physical relations with her and clicked her objectionable photographs and prepared videos.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1166,
      "end": 1384,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kiran",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1184,
          "end": 1189
        },
        {
          "text": "Vijay @ Sonu",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1206,
          "end": 1218
        },
        {
          "text": "SANDEEP",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 1276,
          "end": 1283
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3540014624595642
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "When she regained senses she was shown the said photographs and the videos.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1385,
      "end": 1460,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32341450452804565
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "She was threatened to upload the said obscene material on social media.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1461,
      "end": 1532,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.33673638105392456
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "She did not tell anybody to save herself from embarrassment.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1533,
      "end": 1593,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3193680942058563
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "He called her at different place and maintained physical relations with her and also extracted money.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1594,
      "end": 1695,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3410530388355255
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "Her pregnancy was terminated by way of giving her tablets.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1696,
      "end": 1754,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37226927280426025
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "Once Vijay was making physical relations with her and in the meantime his father Kamlesh Kumar saw them and he turned out Vijay and Kamlesh raped her forcibly.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1755,
      "end": 1914,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vijay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1760,
          "end": 1765
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamlesh Kumar",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1836,
          "end": 1849
        },
        {
          "text": "Vijay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1877,
          "end": 1882
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamlesh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1887,
          "end": 1894
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.33807170391082764
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "Vijay used to send her to different person by taking money.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1915,
      "end": 1974,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vijay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1915,
          "end": 1920
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3410639762878418
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Ultimately, she was fed up from daily exploitation and reported the matter to the police.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1975,
      "end": 2064,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3408864438533783
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "With these allegations present FIR has been registered.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2065,
      "end": 2120,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2079014927148819
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "Counsel for the petitioner argued that the complainant has levelled false allegations against Kamlesh who is 53 years old in order to extract money and put pressure on him.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2121,
      "end": 2294,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kamlesh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2216,
          "end": 2223
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2598067820072174
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "In-fact, the complainant and Kamlesh Kumar vs State Of Haryana on 19 January, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/113008632/\n1 Vijay were having extra marital relations.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2295,
      "end": 2477,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kamlesh Kumar vs State Of Haryana on 19 January, 2023 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2324,
          "end": 2391
        },
        {
          "text": "Vijay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2435,
          "end": 2440
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3148820400238037
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "Both of them were fully aware that they were already married.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2478,
      "end": 2539,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26143085956573486
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "During this period there were general monetary transactions such as payment of bills lending money to each other.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2540,
      "end": 2653,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23369257152080536
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "The other allegations are false.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2654,
      "end": 2686,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21404527127742767
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "Later-on the wife and family members of Vijay came to know about their relationship and said Vijay left the complainant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2687,
      "end": 2807,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vijay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2727,
          "end": 2732
        },
        {
          "text": "Vijay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2780,
          "end": 2785
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1879572570323944
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "In order to take revenge, a false FIR has been got registered.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2808,
      "end": 2870,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2211187332868576
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "It is the complainant who is threatening and blackmailing Vijay Kumar who tried to commit suicide but he was timely saved.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2871,
      "end": 2993,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vijay Kumar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2929,
          "end": 2940
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2140977382659912
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "The entire version put forward by complainant is false and concocted one.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2994,
      "end": 3067,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19420048594474792
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner has referred to one visitor register, Annexure P-5, according to which the complainant and Vijay Kumar used to visit Hotel with their free SANDEEP CRM-M.57627-2022 consent.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3068,
      "end": 3275,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vijay Kumar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3194,
          "end": 3205
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.04617317393422127
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "He has also placed on record two photographs allegedly of the complainant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3276,
      "end": 3350,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13569682836532593
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "It is argued that Kamlesh is ready to join the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3351,
      "end": 3412,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kamlesh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3369,
          "end": 3376
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12758198380470276
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "He will abide by the terms of bail order.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3413,
      "end": 3454,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17538899183273315
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "Therefore, his anticipatory bail application may be allowed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3455,
      "end": 3515,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17005498707294464
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "The bail application is opposed by learned counsel representing the State.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3516,
      "end": 3591,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2527306079864502
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "In the status report it is pointed out that the investigation of the case is going on the statement of complainant and two other co-accused Jeetu and Raja Ram are also arrested.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3592,
      "end": 3769,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Jeetu",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3732,
          "end": 3737
        },
        {
          "text": "Raja Ram",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3742,
          "end": 3750
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21040819585323334
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "There are specific serious allegations of sexual exploitation of the complainant which needs thorough investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3770,
      "end": 3886,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22476346790790558
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "It is prayed that anticipatory bail application filed by the petitioner may be dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3887,
      "end": 3976,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.165343776345253
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 42,
      "text": "I have considered the arguments and have gone through the record.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3977,
      "end": 4043,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 43,
      "text": "The status report produced on record clearly indicates that the investigation in this case is still going on.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4044,
      "end": 4153,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2411894053220749
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 44,
      "text": "The present petitioner Kamlesh is specifically named and there are specific allegations of forcible rape against him.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4154,
      "end": 4271,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kamlesh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 4177,
          "end": 4184
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18992669880390167
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 45,
      "text": "He is yet to join the investigation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4272,
      "end": 4308,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28767654299736023
    },
    {
